## Performance

### 1. Query Optimization
```php
public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
{
    return Appointment::query()
        ->with(['patient:id,first_name,last_name', 'dentist:id,first_name,last_name'])
        ->whereBetween('appointment_date', [$fetchInfo['start'], $fetchInfo['end']])
        ->limit(100) // Limitare sempre i risultati
        ->get()
        ->map($this->transformToEventData(...))
        ->toArray();
}
```

### 2. Caching
```php
public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
{
    $cacheKey = sprintf(
        'calendar_events_%s_%s_%s',
        auth()->id(),
        $fetchInfo['start'],
        $fetchInfo['end']
    );

    return cache()->remember($cacheKey, 300, function () use ($fetchInfo) {
        return $this->getEventsFromDatabase($fetchInfo);
    });
}
```

