## Testing

### 1. Test Widget
```php
/** @test */
public function it_can_fetch_appointments_for_date_range(): void
{
    $appointment = Appointment::factory()->create([
        'appointment_date' => now()->addDays(1),
    ]);

    $widget = new AppointmentCalendarWidget();
    $events = $widget->fetchEvents([
        'start' => now()->format('Y-m-d'),
        'end' => now()->addWeek()->format('Y-m-d'),
    ]);

    $this->assertCount(1, $events);
    $this->assertEquals($appointment->id, $events[0]['id']);
}
```

### 2. Test Permessi
```php
/** @test */
public function it_respects_user_permissions(): void
{
    $user = User::factory()->create();
    $this->actingAs($user);

    $widget = new AppointmentCalendarWidget();
    $events = $widget->fetchEvents([
        'start' => now()->format('Y-m-d'),
        'end' => now()->addWeek()->format('Y-m-d'),
    ]);

    $this->assertEmpty($events);
}
```

## Errori Comuni da Evitare

### 1. Namespace Sbagliato
```php
// SBAGLIATO
namespace Modules\SaluteOra\App\Filament\Widgets;

// CORRETTO
namespace Modules\SaluteOra\Filament\Widgets;
```

### 2. Estensione Diretta
```php
// SBAGLIATO
class MyWidget extends \Saade\FilamentFullCalendar\Widgets\FullCalendarWidget

// CORRETTO
class MyWidget extends \Modules\Xot\Filament\Widgets\XotBaseFullCalendarWidget
```

### 3. Uso di ->label()
```php
// SBAGLIATO
Forms\Components\TextInput::make('title')
    ->label('Titolo Appuntamento')

// CORRETTO
Forms\Components\TextInput::make('title')
    // Il label viene preso da lang/it/appointment.php
```

### 4. Array Options Hardcoded
```php
// SBAGLIATO
Forms\Components\Select::make('status')
    ->options([
        'scheduled' => 'Programmato',
        'confirmed' => 'Confermato',
    ])

// CORRETTO
Forms\Components\Select::make('status')
    ->enum(AppointmentStatus::class)
```

### 5. Metodi che Non Restituiscono Array Associativo
```php
// SBAGLIATO
public function getFormSchema(): array
{
    return [
        Forms\Components\TextInput::make('title'),
        Forms\Components\Select::make('status'),
    ];
}

// CORRETTO
public function getFormSchema(): array
{
    return [
        'title_field' => Forms\Components\TextInput::make('title'),
        'status_field' => Forms\Components\Select::make('status'),
    ];
}
```

## Integrazione Multi-Modulo

### 1. Eventi da Altri Moduli
```php
public function fetchEvents(array $fetchInfo): array
{
    $events = collect();
    
    // Eventi dal modulo SaluteOra
    $appointments = $this->getAppointments($fetchInfo);
    $events = $events->merge($appointments);
    
    // Eventi dal modulo Notification
    if (class_exists(\Modules\Notification\Models\Reminder::class)) {
        $reminders = $this->getReminders($fetchInfo);
        $events = $events->merge($reminders);
    }
    
    return $events->toArray();
}
```

